; The pdfium functions this worker calls, and nothing else.
;
; WHY THIS FILE IS IN THE REPO
;
; The upstream binary distribution ships pdfium.dll and no import library, so
; one is generated from this list at setup time (`cargo xtask deps`). That
; makes the .def a SOURCE artifact rather than a derived one: it is this
; project's declaration of its own interface to pdfium, and it belongs beside
; the code that uses it.
;
; It lived in %TEMP% and was edited by hand. A missing entry does not fail the
; build -- it fails the LINK, later, with an unresolved symbol, which is a
; confusing way to learn that someone called a new function. Adding a call to
; pdfium means adding its name here in the same commit.
LIBRARY pdfium
EXPORTS
FPDF_InitLibrary
FPDF_DestroyLibrary
FPDF_LoadMemDocument64
FPDF_GetPageCount
FPDF_LoadPage
FPDF_ClosePage
FPDF_CloseDocument
FPDF_GetPageWidthF
FPDF_GetPageHeightF
FPDF_RenderPageBitmap
FPDFBitmap_CreateEx
FPDFBitmap_FillRect
FPDFBitmap_GetBuffer
FPDFBitmap_GetStride
FPDFBitmap_Destroy
FPDF_GetLastError
FPDFText_LoadPage
FPDFText_ClosePage
FPDFText_CountChars
FPDFText_GetUnicode
FPDFText_GetCharBox
FPDFText_GetFontSize
